    "summary": "- `DELETE /v1/customers/{id}` soft-deletes (409 `has_active_subscriptions` when a non-canceled subscription exists), and a deleted customer is hidden from every customer endpoint, invoice creation, subscription creation and the CSV export. Its email is reusable.\n- `POST /v1/customers/{id}/restore` works within 30 days (409 `email_taken` on conflict), and `store.PurgeDeletedCustomers(now)` hard-removes customers deleted more than 30 days ago, returning the count. Invoices show `\"customer\": {\"id\",\"name\",\"email\",\"deleted\": true}` for soft-deleted customers and `null` after purge.\n- Checked by new\n...[truncated]",
